    "created_at": "2016-11-24T12:16:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-24T12:16:08Z",
    "body": "Quick experimentation shows that Chrome treats ctrl-click differently from the \"Open in new tab\" context menu item for a link inside `<iframe sandbox>`. Not sure that makes sense. We should probably pick one behavior or the other. Aligning with Firefox is probably reasonable.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
